{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Havenstead</strong> \u2014 a cozy town-builder where strategy and charm go hand-in-hand. Build a thriving village, gather resources, trade with travelers, and balance the needs of your villagers as your settlement grows!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Main Features:</i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic, yet Approachable</strong> \u2013 Dive into the charming town-building vibe, while still balancing supply, demand, and long-term planning with intuitive mechanics that do not require constant micro-management.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villagers Automatically Perform Their Tasks</strong> - Manage your Villagers with the Job Board, and keep track of everything in your Town with in-game overlays.\u00a0 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/56bfef424fb06892b31776c7c32d3d40.poster.avif?t=1758785031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/56bfef424fb06892b31776c7c32d3d40.webm?t=1758785031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/56bfef424fb06892b31776c7c32d3d40.mp4?t=1758785031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy &amp; Immersive</strong> \u2013 Watch everything come alive throughout the town. Take a moment to watch the Fields growing during Spring, Cows grazing at your Cattle Ranches, a Villager chopping down a Tree - or better yet, enjoying an Ale!\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade &amp; Unique Items</strong> \u2013 Traveling traders will visit your town periodically for limited amounts of time. You can trade goods and purchase rare items such as chests with random rewards, rare scrolls unlocking special blueprints, and artifacts like chalices or statues that provide permanent buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/3efc6afb9432b2313cfc59f3868c895a.poster.avif?t=1758785031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/3efc6afb9432b2313cfc59f3868c895a.webm?t=1758785031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/3efc6afb9432b2313cfc59f3868c895a.mp4?t=1758785031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happiness Rating System</strong> \u2013 A dynamic \u201chappiness\u201d score influenced by population size, available supplies, town wealth, commodities like ale, and luxury items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grid-Based Building System</strong> - Smooth building placement with a dedicated grid system.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/fd9a978085002f5abb3edc79dec5bd4e.poster.avif?t=1758785031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/fd9a978085002f5abb3edc79dec5bd4e.webm?t=1758785031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/fd9a978085002f5abb3edc79dec5bd4e.mp4?t=1758785031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Please Note:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Havenstead is under solo development.\u00a0 Public Demo is planned for early 2026, with full release timeline following based on feedback &amp; scaling requirements following that.\u00a0 If you are interested in private playtesting now &amp; through the development process, please join the Discord.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artwork, Animations, 3D Models, Audio, and other assets could still be updated along with additional features before release. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039260?t=1758785031","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039260?t=1758785031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/431b8584cb2b8f18ff5ab901a9f4d67c8e9c13b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758785031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/431b8584cb2b8f18ff5ab901a9f4d67c8e9c13b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758785031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Havenstead</strong> \u2014 a cozy town-builder where strategy and charm go hand-in-hand. Build a thriving village, gather resources, trade with travelers, and balance the needs of your villagers as your settlement grows!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Main Features:</i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic, yet Approachable</strong> \u2013 Dive into the charming town-building vibe, while still balancing supply, demand, and long-term planning with intuitive mechanics that do not require constant micro-management.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villagers Automatically Perform Their Tasks</strong> - Manage your Villagers with the Job Board, and keep track of everything in your Town with in-game overlays.\u00a0 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/56bfef424fb06892b31776c7c32d3d40.poster.avif?t=1758785031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/56bfef424fb06892b31776c7c32d3d40.webm?t=1758785031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/56bfef424fb06892b31776c7c32d3d40.mp4?t=1758785031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy &amp; Immersive</strong> \u2013 Watch everything come alive throughout the town. Take a moment to watch the Fields growing during Spring, Cows grazing at your Cattle Ranches, a Villager chopping down a Tree - or better yet, enjoying an Ale!\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade &amp; Unique Items</strong> \u2013 Traveling traders will visit your town periodically for limited amounts of time. You can trade goods and purchase rare items such as chests with random rewards, rare scrolls unlocking special blueprints, and artifacts like chalices or statues that provide permanent buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039260/extras/3efc6afb9432b2313cfc59f3868c895a.poster.avif?t=1758785031\"